# backend/db/liquibase.properties is safe, required template source
# (${DB_*} envsubst placeholders only, no secrets) that the db Dockerfile
# COPYs at build time. The monorepo root .gitignore's bare `liquibase.properties`
# basename rule would otherwise silently exclude it from every commit of this
# template's own working tree.
!backend/db/liquibase.properties
